# Run artifacts — content-addressed, regenerated by any run.
# Broad on purpose: --store takes an arbitrary directory, and an artifact tree
# committed by accident is ~57 KB of event log per run. Convention: any --store
# directory is dot-prefixed, and the patterns below cover the ones the docs use.
*artifacts*/
.case*/
.demo*/
.run*/

# Caches
.c4tmp/
.DS_Store
